{"step_index":687,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-06T05:21:01Z","input_tokens":3586,"cache_read_tokens":56930,"output_tokens":1055,"thinking":"**Analyzing Pokemon Switching Logic**\n\nI'm now investigating Pokemon switching logic. I've found a call to `is_hp_low` within `src/modes/base.py` on line 74: `is_low, hp_pct = self.bot.is_hp_low(f_act)`. It appears this might be key, given the `is_hp_low` function. I think this might be the place where the logic is implemented. I'm going to look at other calls to this method.\n\n\n**Clarifying HP Detection Methods**\n\nI'm now clarifying the use of HP detection methods. My current plan involves removing `read_hunter_hp`, `use_potion_sequence`, and potentially `is_hp_low` from the codebase, based on user feedback and the context of Smeargle's specific needs. I've re-examined how these methods utilize OCR and color masking for health status and I can confirm that they serve specific needs. I am now double-checking where those are being used to confirm which to remove.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"# Plan: Eliminación de Lógica de HP y Swap de Pokémon\n\n## Objetivos\n1. **Remover `read_hunter_hp` (OCR)**: Eliminar la función en `src/bot_main.py` que intenta leer el HP del cazador mediante OCR, ya que falla con barras verdes y da falsos 0.\n2. **Remover `use_potion_sequence`**: Eliminar la secuencia en `src/controller.py` que abre el menú y selecciona el Pokémon (`_press('z')`), ya que al usar Smeargle de forma exclusiva, nunca es necesario cambiar Pokémon ni curarlo en combate de esta forma.\n3. **Limpieza General**: Asegurarnos de que no quede ningún código fantasma que intente triggerear curaciones de HP o cambios de Pokémon.\n\n## Archivos a Modificar\n- `src/bot_main.py`: Eliminar def `read_hunter_hp`.\n- `src/controller.py`: Eliminar def `use_potion_sequence`.\n\n## Estado Actual\nHe revisado el código a fondo y he confirmado que la lógica de cambio de Pokémon y lectura de HP del cazador existe en estas funciones. Al eliminarlas, el bot dejará de intentar curar o cambiar a Smeargle por falsos positivos del OCR.\n\n## Siguientes Pasos\nUna vez apruebes el plan, ejecutaré los borrados y haré el commit en el repositorio.\n","Description":"Plan to remove Hunter HP checking and potion/swap sequences.","TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Brian\\.gemini\\antigravity-cli\\brain\\dab6a3d4-72ff-45ea-898a-cdc9ce4a7ca1\\plan_remove_hp_logic.md","toolAction":"Writing plan","toolSummary":"Write HP plan"}}]}
